WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The Close button buys a leg back at market. It is grey when the bot's rule does not allow it, and the hover says why.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:24.000
It is active only on the side the bot no longer sells. That is, in a confirmed negative regime: puts in a bear trend, or calls in a bull trend.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Before you confirm, read the window. A market buy pays the asking price, the spread and a fee. The result so far becomes final.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:50.000
It also says what follows. The side is held like after a stop-loss, so the bot does not sell it again at once.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:02.000
If it is the last leg of the strangle, the note is red. The slot becomes empty and the bot opens a new entry there.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:15.000
If you are unsure, cancel. Nothing is sent until you confirm, and every close is recorded with who made it.
